WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.800
Chunyu Yi was taken away by the officers, and little Tiying clung to her father, crying out.

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:08.222
The neighbors stood at their doors, watching it all with worry.

00:00:08.572 --> 00:00:13.900
Her father was escorted to Chang'an, and Tiying, heedless of the hardship, followed the prison cart all the way.

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:18.450
The mountain road was rough; her shoes wore through, yet she would not stop to rest.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:23.408
At night, Tiying wrote her petition by lamplight, resolved to take the punishment in her father's place.

00:00:23.758 --> 00:00:27.430
Stroke by stroke, she carefully wrote down the words in her heart.

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:31.788
At daybreak, Tiying knelt before the palace gate and presented her petition with both hands.

00:00:32.138 --> 00:00:36.338
The gate officials were amazed that one so young could be so brave.

00:00:36.688 --> 00:00:40.576
Emperor Wen read the petition and was deeply moved by the girl's devotion to her father.

00:00:40.926 --> 00:00:44.454
The great hall fell silent, and the officials held their breath.

00:00:44.804 --> 00:00:48.884
The emperor ordered the cruel corporal punishments abolished, and new laws put into practice.

00:00:49.234 --> 00:00:53.266
Father and daughter were finally reunited, embracing tightly in the sunset.

00:00:53.616 --> 00:00:58.416
Tiying's devotion moved countless people, and her story is still told today.

